      "filename": "Guile Point East (geograph 4790077).jpg",
      "title": "File:Guile Point East (geograph 4790077).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/Guile_Point_East_%28geograph_4790077%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
