      "description": "Fish, found in a field, Lindisfarne I found this fish, alive, in a field near the shingle banks towards the top of Lindisfarne - assume it had been caught and then dropped by a bird.  Photo taken as proof I found a live fish in a field - fish then handed to husband to put it in the sea as he is quicker on rocks than I am and I was worried fish would die.  He had my camera on his shoulder and as he bent down to put the fish back on the sea he also dropped my camera - camera now not working - fish survived",
